efined in: [react-table/src/useLegacyTable.ts:342](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/react-table/src/useLegacyTable.ts#L342)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue` = `unknown`\n\n## Deprecated\n\nUse ColumnDef<TFeatures, TData, TValue> with useTable instead.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: LegacyColumnDef\ntitle: LegacyColumnDef\n---\n\n# ~~Type Alias: LegacyColumnDef\\<TData, TValue\\>~~\n\n```ts\ntype LegacyColumnDef<TData, TValue> = ColumnDef<LegacyFeatures, TData, TValue>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [react-table/src/useLegacyTable.ts:342](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/react-table/src/useLegacyTable.ts#L342)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue` = `unknown`\n\n## Deprecated\n\nUse ColumnDef<TFeatures, TData, TValue> with useTable instead.\n"}
